                        ],
                        "form": "der Contenance"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c88e3a5f-e9af-48c0-8985-da97945a1c70",
                        "entry_id": "7a17c6bd-38cc-3be9-bf09-962ff5c7f6b9",
                        "tags": [
                            "dative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "der Contenance"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "062becbf-1067-4887-8598-b9a61b56f3cf",
                        "entry_id": "7a17c6bd-38cc-3be9-bf09-962ff5c7f6b9",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Contenance"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                        "entry_id": "7a17c6bd-38cc-3be9-bf09-962ff5c7f6b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fassung, Selbstbeherrschung in einer schwierigen Situation"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "135d97d5-dcec-499e-9c37-b564093e48c6",
                                "sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                                "text": "Bewahren Sie vor Ihrem Chef stets die Contenance!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dbf9265-fcd2-42fd-b053-faf5e0bccf64",
                                "sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                                "text": "„Obwohl der Laden brummte und sich an der Annonce die Bons türmten, bewahrte der Küchenchef die Contenance und stand mir geduldig Rede und Antwort.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79d32a21-678e-4e22-97ea-45fdb18ab0af",
                                "sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                                "text": "„Und auf einmal ist Merkel die Frau, die sich durch die Ebenen müht, mit den Putins, Trumps und Erdoğans dieser Welt herumschlagen, dabei aber stets auch staatsfrauliche Contenance wahren muss.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7769131-1486-46fb-9192-3543ae4a287b",
                                "sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                                "text": "„Den Experimentierkoffer können sie hier vergessen, dachte er, während er langsam seine Contenance wiederfand.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b565be5-4aaf-4a4e-980a-a6755f3ddb43",
                                "sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                                "text": "„Wie lange schafft man es, die Contenance zu wahren?“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d3170a2d-bbd2-4f0c-acc4-0fdff9403e37",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a17c6bd-38cc-3be9-bf09-962ff5c7f6b9",
                        "source_sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fassung, Selbstbeherrschung in einer schwierigen Situation",
                        "target_lang_word": "composure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "composure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Calmness of mind or temperament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "809ad7ea-fed6-48b0-bd27-964cfc02da81",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "That all may see who hate us, how we seek\nPeace and composure […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15827bb5-1232-43da-a9ef-00542b238d3d",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "It would be also of great Use to us to form our deliberate Judgments of Persons and Things in the calmest and serenest Hours of Life, when the Passions of Nature are all silent, and the Mind enjoys its most perfect Composure […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af699b24-2944-42df-b1f9-e6ff28b402fd",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "“Did you want anything, ma’am?” I enquired, still preserving my external composure, in spite of her ghastly countenance and strange exaggerated manner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10443e7d-3ea6-479f-8dc2-882baed6bd84",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "He began to lose his composure, and made mistakes, his cards got mixed up, and his scoring was wild."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "310b26fa-94bd-447e-b0a2-225faf120e02",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "Montenegro's early composure was shaken by that set-back and a visibly buoyed Wales nearly added a second goal when Bale broke past two defenders and fired a long-range shot that Bozovic tipped over"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "759dfa33-0bc8-34d3-8357-964aceef12ca",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of composing"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ea9b986-f3e3-43c9-8fda-dc478e86b7b6",
                                                "sense_id": "759dfa33-0bc8-34d3-8357-964aceef12ca",
                                                "text": "1818, John Evelyn, Memoirs, edited by William Bray, London: Henry Colburn, 2nd edition, Volume I, entry for 10 March, 1685, p. 592,\n[…] Signʳ Pietro […] had an admirable way both of composure [in music] and teaching."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "715734af-921e-3452-81c6-01f37d2ef687",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which is composed; a composition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a317a04-8dfb-31bb-b50e-bbc15d4e86c3",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Orderly adjustment; disposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd244d88-76f9-48fb-a07a-4fe68ac6c6ef",
                                                "sense_id": "1a317a04-8dfb-31bb-b50e-bbc15d4e86c3",
                                                "text": "[…] from the various Composures and Combinations of these Corpusoles together, happen all the Varieties of the Bodies formed out of them […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "591cc88a-56f2-38b4-ba94-97253877bb0b",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Frame; make; temperament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b117555-b20d-4ff9-a957-fa6627c33cb7",
                                                "sense_id": "591cc88a-56f2-38b4-ba94-97253877bb0b",
                                                "text": "[…] his composure must be rare indeed\nWhom these things can not blemish […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7537d462-a7cd-3cff-8db8-9c722e14221e",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A combination; a union; a bond."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "444491ac-458f-4ab8-9bcf-7459be83aa9f",
                                                "sense_id": "7537d462-a7cd-3cff-8db8-9c722e14221e",
                                                "text": "[…] their fraction is more our wish than their faction: but it was a strong composure a fool could disunite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12ac9371-35f1-44b4-a52b-fded3af0803a",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a17c6bd-38cc-3be9-bf09-962ff5c7f6b9",
                        "source_sense_id": "4c327813-3658-3e6c-a9e6-5dd7cb2775b4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fassung, Selbstbeherrschung in einer schwierigen Situation",
                        "target_lang_word": "contenance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "contenance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d45495b7-2df3-3dc7-8aaa-6cd8cbe9946c",
                                        "entry_id": "5132681e-2bde-3ba7-a1ce-141f0c15e919",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capacité ou étendue superficielle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "988dcd44-f579-49c8-b5d0-53cc1c5cf349",
                                                "sense_id": "d45495b7-2df3-3dc7-8aaa-6cd8cbe9946c",
                                                "text": "Ce parc est d’une contenance de cent hectares. - Cette citerne a une contenance de cent mètres-cubes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                        "entry_id": "5132681e-2bde-3ba7-a1ce-141f0c15e919",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manière de se tenir, de se présenter devant une personne ou d’autres personnes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bde1a262-a520-4112-b637-ecf0eed7169d",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "Il était visible, à la contenance du maître, qu’il était d’un caractère franc mais impétueux et irascible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1970f86a-dc5e-49f7-9bec-ab0b1c65ec3d",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "Je faisais la plus étrange contenance du monde ; je pâlissais, je rougissais, j’avais des éblouissements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15f48dac-127a-4866-a46a-0fb59e28904a",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "Est-ce le chagrin, est-ce le bonheur qui prête à la femme de trente ans, à la femme heureuse ou malheureuse, le secret de cette contenance éloquente ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "542f015d-df84-4b30-a6a5-76dd160c175e",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "Sitôt qu’elles ne furent plus seules dans le compartiment, ces dames prirent une contenance grave, et se mirent à parler de choses relevées pour donner une bonne opinion d’elles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7926882-531c-46e3-85f3-89b26d4c03cb",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "J'ai bien cru que c'était une de ces femmes comme on en voit beaucoup, qui prennent un mari pour avoir une contenance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be6639db-cf03-471b-88df-d36eeaf9a7ad",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "Trois ou quatre personnes, en effet, erraient sur la place en jetant de fréquents regards à l’hôtel. On sentait qu’elles cherchaient une contenance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08146c8b-87b6-40a0-9bcd-0744ac95c1a4",
                                                "sense_id": "bed74d1d-1ac0-333b-8263-12f7f9522aeb",
                                                "text": "Mais je n'avais aucune idée de ce que je voulais faire, ni avec quelle contenance (blague? détachement? enthousiasme? maturité?) …."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "65a08db6-2c2d-4c3a-836f-bbece7c2fdfe",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a17c6bd-38cc-3be9-bf09-962ff5c7f6b9",
